{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47275","headline":"游仙二十四首 十二 · 吴筠","name":"游仙二十四首 十二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"停骖太仪侧，整服金阙前。\n肃肃承上帝，锵锵会羣仙。\n鸿鑪发灵香，广庑张钧天。\n玉醴洽中座，霞膏充四筵。\n良期无终极，俛仰移亿年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47275.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47275","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}